' BloomQuest Family - Use Case Flows
'
' Each diagram is in its own file under docs/diagrams/ for PlantUML compatibility.
' PlantUML requires one @startuml/@enduml block per file.
'
' Diagrams:
'   01-use-case-diagram.puml       - Full use case diagram (actors + use cases)
'   02-task-completion-flow.puml   - Task Completion & Approval activity flow
'   03-reward-redemption-flow.puml - Reward Redemption activity flow
'   04-parent-auth-flow.puml       - Parent Authentication activity flow
'   05-child-auth-flow.puml        - Child Authentication (PIN) activity flow
'   06-quest-pool-flow.puml        - Quest Pool Selection activity flow
'   07-recurring-task-flow.puml    - Recurring Task Generation (Cron) activity flow
'   08-evidence-lifecycle-flow.puml - Evidence & Memory Lifecycle activity flow
'   09-habit-fading-flow.puml      - Habit Building & Fading activity flow
'   10-data-backup-flow.puml       - Data Backup activity flow
